        type: 'prompt',
        label: 'Name the structure',
        text: "I will describe three features of an app, and I want you to ask me what structure each one needs before you say anything yourself: (1) a list of messages waiting to be sent that must be sent in order and retried twice when they fail, (2) a Back button that also has a Forward button, (3) a folder view that lets the user collapse and expand sub-folders. For each, ask me one question that helps me name the structure, wait for my reply, and then tell me whether my choice fits and what its main operation costs.",
